    "移动失败，恢复原位置也未完成。请刷新目录，检查临时文件“%@”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The move failed, and the original location could not be restored. Refresh the folder and check the temporary file “%@”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移动失败，恢复原位置也未完成。请刷新目录，检查临时文件“%@”。"
