    "设备正被 Android File Transfer 占用，请退出它后重试。插上设备时登录项“Android File Transfer Agent”会自动打开它，可在“系统设置 > 通用 > 登录项与扩展”里关掉。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The device is in use by Android File Transfer. Quit it and try again. The login item “Android File Transfer Agent” reopens it whenever a device is plugged in; you can turn it off in System Settings > General > Login Items & Extensions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备正被 Android File Transfer 占用，请退出它后重试。插上设备时登录项“Android File Transfer Agent”会自动打开它，可在“系统设置 > 通用 > 登录项与扩展”里关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设备没有提供可访问的存储。请解锁设备，并在设备的 USB 选项里选“文件传输”后重试": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The device isn’t offering any accessible storage. Unlock it, choose “File Transfer” in its USB options, and try again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备没有提供可访问的存储。请解锁设备，并在设备的 USB 选项里选“文件传输”后重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设备的 USB 文件传输接口正被电脑上的“%@”占用，关掉它后重试": {
